AICE-javítás a storytold/pdfcraft v0.6.0 webes (WASM) buildjéhez — csak target_arch = "wasm32",
a natív build változatlan. A beágyazott szerkesztőben nincs közösségi/idegen link:

AICE-CHANGE: the tab bar's Discord button is not shown;
AICE-CHANGE: the Home screen's "Join the ArtCraft community" card and the About dialog's Discord/website/GitHub links are gone;
AICE-CHANGE: the Help commands (menu and search) have no Discord, web page, GitHub, ArtCraft website and "Check for updates" items.

Alkalmazás:  git -C <pdfcraft> apply 0001-aice-branding.patch   (vagy: patch -d <pdfcraft> -p1)

diff -ruN -x target -x dist -x '*.ttf' -x '*.orig' pdfcraft.orig/crates/engine/src/commands.rs pdfcraft/crates/engine/src/commands.rs
--- pdfcraft.orig/crates/engine/src/commands.rs
+++ pdfcraft/crates/engine/src/commands.rs
@@ -343,10 +343,17 @@
     c("page.split", "Split document…", PAGES, None, Assembly, "scissors"),
     c("page.number", "Number pages…", PAGES, None, Assembly, "hash"),
     c("help.shortcuts", "Keyboard shortcuts", HELP, None, Nothing, "circle-help"),
+    // AICE: the embedded web editor lists no community links and no update check (it is updated
+    // with the site that hosts it).
+    #[cfg(not(target_arch = "wasm32"))]
     c("help.discord", "Join the ArtCraft Discord", HELP, None, Nothing, "messages-square"),
+    #[cfg(not(target_arch = "wasm32"))]
     c("help.app_page", "PdfCraft web page", HELP, None, Nothing, "globe"),
+    #[cfg(not(target_arch = "wasm32"))]
     c("help.github", "PdfCraft on GitHub", HELP, None, Nothing, "code-xml"),
+    #[cfg(not(target_arch = "wasm32"))]
     c("help.website", "ArtCraft website", HELP, None, Nothing, "external-link"),
+    #[cfg(not(target_arch = "wasm32"))]
     c("help.check_updates", "Check for updates…", HELP, None, Nothing, "cloud"),
     c("help.about", "About PdfCraft", HELP, None, Nothing, "info"),
 ];
